{"lyrics":"[00:01.48]Uh-huh, uh (heard you fucked, heard you fucked my mans)\n[00:05.54]Uh, fuck, uh (fucked my mans)\n[00:06.34]Fucked my mans, woah (Woah, woah, woah, woah)\n[00:08.56]Woah, one take, one take gang\n[00:09.22]I'm your man (one take, one take gang)\n[00:12.30]I'm your man (one take, one take gang)\n[00:14.88]One take, one take gang\n[00:15.62]Hey, nine-nine-nine, one take, one take gang (Heard you fucked my mans on the low, ho)\n[00:21.12]Haha, ya' dig?\n[00:25.56]Heard you fucked my mans on the low, ho (On the low)\n[00:28.36]For some tickets to my Chicago show, ho (Lil' ho)\n[00:31.62]I've been balling on these hoes, feel like Michael (Swish)\n[00:34.82]Ayy, baby, keep that on the low though (On the low, on the low, on the low)\n[00:40.60]Ayy, huh, ayy, bands on me got more dope (Cash)\n[00:41.56]Huh, ayy, I'm a dragon, boy, you a Komodo (You know what I mean, nine)\n[00:44.66]Pose, huh, yeah, life's a photo (Splash)\n[00:47.22]Huh, ayy, pull up on the scene with my bros (Gang)\n[00:50.80]Ayy, runnin' through the 6 like my woes, Drake, huh (Ya' dig?)\n[00:54.36]Pockets fat, look like Ricky Rozay, huh (Ya' dig?)\n[00:57.60]Money on deck, baby, okay, huh (Rich)\n[01:00.22]I ain't savin' hoes, baby, no way, huh (Bitch)\n[01:04.76]Ayy, huh, phew, ninty on the e-way (Skrrt, ha)\n[01:07.16]500k for my car, so it's not the freeway (Skrrt-skrrt)\n[01:10.18]I remember staining Bathing Ape on eBay (I was broke)\n[01:13.18]Now I'm finna go to Bathing Ape with 10k (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[01:16.06]I don't even like that shit no more, it's all about Murakami (Ya' dig?)\n[01:19.50]I say that shit right, it's not, “Murakani“ baby girl, use your phonics (Ya' dig?)\n[01:22.62]Huh, I've been ballin' super hard, baby, I'm a ballaholic, huh (Ya' dig?)\n[01:25.94]Slash alcoholic (Ya' dig?), huh, slash Percaholic (Ya' dig?), huh, slash Percules (Woo)\n[01:30.48]Phew, pray to god these drugs ain't hurtin' me (Amen)\n[01:34.02]Ayy, uh, gun on my hip, so I'm not worried